(7594736, 1224930, 156466, '<td valign="top">I want to really like this, because it is well shot and well processed, but it''s such a non sequitur as I move across the frame that I wish (not knowing what else is around) that you''d either moved left and rotated to cut the city out or moved forward and got rid of the rock that dwarfed the world. Just doesn''t work for me as is.<br/> <br/>Came back to look again. Bumping.</td>', 'I want to really like this, because it is well shot and well processed, but it''s such a non sequitur as I move across the frame that I wish (not knowing what else is around) that you''d either moved left and rotated to cut the city out or moved forward and got rid of the rock that dwarfed the world. Just doesn''t work for me as is. Came back to look again. Bumping.', '2018-09-02 14:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
