(7594928, 1225204, 87808, '<td valign="top">My comment, was a compliment BTW. Love this landscape, usually I am after the contrast and darkness, but you have pulled off a dreamy skyscape that tells it''s own story. It is so pretty. Now I see it is Florida, I am searching out for an alligator. Even though I know there probably i''snt one in there, Florida just brings up memories of me seeing alligators all the time on the side of the road, rivers, as our bus driver pointed them out every 5 seconds.</td>', 'My comment, was a compliment BTW. Love this landscape, usually I am after the contrast and darkness, but you have pulled off a dreamy skyscape that tells it''s own story. It is so pretty. Now I see it is Florida, I am searching out for an alligator. Even though I know there probably i''snt one in there, Florida just brings up memories of me seeing alligators all the time on the side of the road, rivers, as our bus driver pointed them out every 5 seconds.', '2018-09-04 00:03:59.000000', NULL, 0),
