(7594958, 1224953, 173844, '<td valign="top">This incredible image was my clear favorite for this challenge.  I gave it a 9 --  what was I thinking, and how I regret not just making my enjoyment and admiration completely expressed with a 10.  The generous foreground, transitioning across muddy water to the line of trees and mountains, and then the amazing turmoil in the sky --  all in focus and wonderfully processed to impart the beautiful, moody atmosphere.  The graininess of the clouds strikes me as perfectly conveying the sense that everything is set to explode into wild weather.  Terrific.  Is this also Parker Lake?</td>', 'This incredible image was my clear favorite for this challenge.  I gave it a 9 --  what was I thinking, and how I regret not just making my enjoyment and admiration completely expressed with a 10.  The generous foreground, transitioning across muddy water to the line of trees and mountains, and then the amazing turmoil in the sky --  all in focus and wonderfully processed to impart the beautiful, moody atmosphere.  The graininess of the clouds strikes me as perfectly conveying the sense that everything is set to explode into wild weather.  Terrific.  Is this also Parker Lake?', '2018-09-04 16:02:39.000000', NULL, 0),
