(7595799, 1224952, 124815, '<td valign="top">This was my highest mark in this (postcards) challenge and by far the most interesting. For me the wheels created the story that so many landscapes lack. The two "main characters" talk incessantly with each other from immemorial times about every pebble and the novel presence of the wheels made their day. Mine too. Beautiful pp.</td>', 'This was my highest mark in this (postcards) challenge and by far the most interesting. For me the wheels created the story that so many landscapes lack. The two "main characters" talk incessantly with each other from immemorial times about every pebble and the novel presence of the wheels made their day. Mine too. Beautiful pp.', '2018-09-10 22:38:43.000000', NULL, 0),
